51
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:30,320
So when you're thinking
about an aircraft,

52
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:33,920
one piece of information is
its standard empty weight.

53
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:36,140
So that's the weight
