226
00:10:44,530 --> 00:10:45,820
Why is it not a good thing?

227
00:10:49,540 --> 00:10:51,870
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

228
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:54,450
TINA SRIVASTAVA: Yeah, so
basically, if your stall speed

229
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:58,590
has increased, that means you're
likely to stall at a higher

230
00:10:58,590 --> 00:10:59,530
